                                                            </div>
                                                            <div style="margin-top: 0.45rem;">
                                                                <label style="font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 600; color: #451a03; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;">
                                                                    Format Nomor Sertifikat (Opsional / Custom):
